sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Agent as Edit Agent
  participant SM as State Manager
  participant FS as Outputs Folder

  User->>Agent: Submit edit request
  Agent->>SM: snapshot(v2)
  SM->>FS: Copy state + assets
  Agent->>FS: Apply changes + rerun phase
  Agent->>SM: snapshot(v3)
  User->>Agent: Undo to v2
  Agent->>SM: revert(v2)
  SM->>FS: Restore state + assets
